WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.066 --> 00:00:03.900
Kalos League battle heat!

2
00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:06.733
Malva here. Reporting live.

3
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.400
The Kalos League is underway. We're well into the battle action.

4
00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:14.633
Let's all take a look at a summary of our battles up to this point.

5
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.500
In the first bout, the action was between Trevor and his Mega Charizard,

6
00:00:19.566 --> 00:00:22.766
facing off against Alain and his Mega Charizard.

7
00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:26.766
Next, there was a riveting appearance by Ash's Greninja.

8
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.566
But, without a doubt, the highlight of this tournament

9
00:00:29.633 --> 00:00:32.866
has got to be the Mega-Evolved Pokémon competing here.

10
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.600
Pokémon such as Astrid's Mega Absol

11
00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:39.200
and Remo's Mega Garchomp

12
00:00:39.266 --> 00:00:42.700
are bringing a level of mega excitement to the Kalos League

13
00:00:42.766 --> 00:00:44.666
unlike anything we've seen before.

14
00:00:44.733 --> 00:00:47.700
I can hardly wait for more battle action to come.

15
00:00:47.766 --> 00:00:49.900
And I'm sure you feel the same way.

16
00:00:54.866 --> 00:00:58.633
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

17
00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:02.733
♪ Knock me down, I'll just get up again ♪

18
00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:05.933
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

19
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.833
♪ Pokémon ♪

20
00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:10.300
- ♪ Pokémon ♪
- ♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

21
00:01:10.366 --> 00:01:13.566
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

22
00:01:13.633 --> 00:01:15.566
♪ Pokémon ♪

23
00:01:15.633 --> 00:01:18.433
- ♪ Pokémon ♪
- ♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

24
00:01:29.033 --> 00:01:30.933
Now, Absol, Psycho Cut!

25
00:01:33.733 --> 00:01:35.500
Hawlucha, Flying Press!

26
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.400
Absol, no!

27
00:01:46.466 --> 00:01:48.233
Absol is unable to battle!

28
00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:50.366
Which means Ash is the winner!

29
00:01:50.666 --> 00:01:52.333
Yeah!

30
00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:57.466
Following his victory against Astrid, Ash will be moving on to the semifinals!

31
00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:03.033
Ash!

32
00:02:03.533 --> 00:02:05.333
- Hey, Sawyer.
- The semifinals!

33
00:02:05.766 --> 00:02:07.933
- Congratulations.
- Thanks.

34
00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:09.833
You're up soon, Sawyer.

35
00:02:10.266 --> 00:02:12.333
That's right. And I'll win.

36
00:02:12.833 --> 00:02:13.866
Hmm.

37
00:02:14.633 --> 00:02:15.666
Ash...

38
00:02:16.233 --> 00:02:17.666
remember what you said?

39
00:02:18.333 --> 00:02:22.200
We'll battle at the Kalos League. I'm gonna break my losing streak.

40
00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.633
Then you and I will even the score.

41
00:02:27.833 --> 00:02:29.633
Yeah. You're on, Ash.

42
00:02:31.033 --> 00:02:32.333
That's why I'll win.

43
00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.833
Yeah. But Tierno's really strong.

44
00:02:36.266 --> 00:02:38.133
Tierno's your friend, isn't he?

45
00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:41.733
- That's right.
- Watching his first and second battles,

46
00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:45.333
I know I need to be careful against Tierno's rhythmic battling style.

47
00:02:47.666 --> 00:02:49.566
I'll mess with his rhythm, that's all.

48
00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:54.000
- Yeah, that's the spirit.
- So, I'll be as prepared as I can be.

49
00:02:54.666 --> 00:02:57.133
I also have a secret weapon all set.

50
00:02:57.633 --> 00:02:58.800
A secret weapon?

51
00:02:59.566 --> 00:03:01.200
Super-secret.

52
00:03:01.833 --> 00:03:02.666
See you soon.

53
00:03:04.766 --> 00:03:06.133
Okay. Good luck.

54
00:03:06.766 --> 00:03:08.833
So, Ash made it to the next round.

55
00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:11.933
I can't lose until I've kept my promise.

56
00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:15.833
Okay, over here, over here. Time for another interview.

57
00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:21.733
All these interviews... Why do we have to run around here

58
00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.233
like there's no tomorrow?

59
00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:27.866
I agree. We don't get a second to steal even one of the pickable Pokémon

60
00:03:27.933 --> 00:03:29.466
here at the Kalos League.

61
00:03:29.533 --> 00:03:33.766
Steal them? How? We can't even figure out which ones are worth the time.

62
00:03:33.833 --> 00:03:36.166
Pikachu's right under our noses.

63
00:03:38.333 --> 00:03:40.166
This dude needs a nap.

64
00:03:41.366 --> 00:03:43.233
Remo's the winner!

65
00:03:43.833 --> 00:03:47.233
We now have three competitors qualified for the semifinals.

66
00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:50.166
Which means there's just one slot left.

67
00:03:52.133 --> 00:03:53.366
- Hi!
- Huh?

68
00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:55.600
Did I make it?

69
00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:58.333
- Shauna!
- Yeah, you just did.

70
00:03:58.833 --> 00:04:02.100
- Tierno's battle is about to start.
- That's a relief.

71
00:04:02.166 --> 00:04:04.200
Nice to see you, Serena. How've you been?

72
00:04:04.266 --> 00:04:06.766
I'm great. Looks like you're doing well, too.

73
00:04:06.833 --> 00:04:08.533
I feel great.

74
00:04:08.766 --> 00:04:11.633
- How's Ash?
- He's moving on to the semifinals.

75
00:04:12.366 --> 00:04:13.633
Hey, it's Shauna.

76
00:04:13.933 --> 00:04:17.366
Hi, Ash. I hear you're moving on to the semifinals, right?

77
00:04:17.433 --> 00:04:19.700
- Yeah!
- Who's Tierno battling against?

78
00:04:19.766 --> 00:04:24.066
- He's battling a trainer named Sawyer.
- Sawyer's pretty strong.

79
00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.433
I even lost to him one time.

80
00:04:26.966 --> 00:04:28.933
Hmm. He's that strong?

81
00:04:29.366 --> 00:04:32.366
Not only is he strong, he's an impressive analyst.

82
00:04:32.433 --> 00:04:34.433
Sounds like a tough battle.

83
00:04:35.933 --> 00:04:38.800
And for our last battle before the semifinals?

84
00:04:39.866 --> 00:04:43.100
It's Tierno versus Sawyer!

85
00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:47.033
And here's where our competitors will be battling it out.

86
00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:49.366
A wasteland field!

87
00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:56.333
Now, for your Pokémon!

88
00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:58.033
Aegislash, let's go!

89
00:04:59.666 --> 00:05:01.566
- Aegislash!
- Whoa.

90
00:05:01.633 --> 00:05:03.000
- Check it out.
- Pika?

91
00:05:04.533 --> 00:05:05.533
Aegislash.

92
00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:08.500
The Royal Sword Pokémon, an evolved form of Doublade.

93
00:05:08.566 --> 00:05:12.266
Stories say Aegislash can detect the natural qualities of leadership,

94
00:05:12.333 --> 00:05:16.266
- recognizing a true king.
- So, his Doublade evolved, then.

95
00:05:16.566 --> 00:05:20.333
And now what Pokémon will Tierno be using?

96
00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:24.500
Ludicolo, it's time to dance!

97
00:05:25.866 --> 00:05:27.100
Ludicolo!

98
00:05:30.333 --> 00:05:34.000
Feast your eyes on Ludicolo's masterful dancing!

99
00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:37.433
Wow, look at them go.

100
00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:40.066
Tierno and Ludicolo are in perfect unison.

101
00:05:40.366 --> 00:05:41.900
Lots of luck, Sawyer!

102
00:05:41.966 --> 00:05:43.433
And you, too, Tierno!

103
00:05:45.933 --> 00:05:47.533
I hope they both do well.

104
00:05:47.966 --> 00:05:49.666
Battle begin!

105
00:05:58.633 --> 00:06:01.633
Now, here we go with our battling beat!

106
00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:03.533
Rock it with Rain Dance!

107
00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:04.800
Ludicolo!

108
00:06:13.733 --> 00:06:14.833
Rain Dance, huh?

109
00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:18.133
That means water-type moves will be stronger now.

110
00:06:18.333 --> 00:06:19.833
Completely textbook.

111
00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:21.700
I know what to do.

112
00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.233
Aegislash, use Swords Dance!

113
00:06:31.466 --> 00:06:34.700
So, they're using Swords Dance to raise attack power.

114
00:06:34.766 --> 00:06:38.000
Tierno used Rain Dance to take advantage of the field,

115
00:06:38.066 --> 00:06:40.433
and then Sawyer responded brilliantly.

116
00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.300
I wonder which one will come out on top.

117
00:06:43.733 --> 00:06:46.633
- Use Swords Dance once again!
- Use Hydro Pump!

118
00:06:47.033 --> 00:06:50.000
Ludicolo!

119
00:06:50.066 --> 00:06:51.133
It's fast.

120
00:06:52.566 --> 00:06:56.933
Ludicolo's ability is swift swim. Rain Dance increases water-type moves,

121
00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:59.866
and Swift Swim boosts Ludicolo's speed in rainy weather.

122
00:07:00.566 --> 00:07:01.866
Very nice.

123
00:07:02.566 --> 00:07:04.333
Now, finish with Hydro Pump!

124
00:07:06.033 --> 00:07:07.200
Use Slash!

125
00:07:11.666 --> 00:07:13.633
Aegislash, you okay?

126
00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:17.366
-Yo! Yo, yo! Are you giving up, bro?

127
00:07:18.166 --> 00:07:22.266
Aegislash just can't seem to handle Ludicolo's power and speed!

128
00:07:25.866 --> 00:07:28.100
Ludicolo's so fast and strong.

129
00:07:28.433 --> 00:07:29.866
This doesn't look good.

130
00:07:29.933 --> 00:07:31.900
Ludicolo's really well-trained.

131
00:07:31.966 --> 00:07:33.700
Tierno worked really hard.

132
00:07:33.766 --> 00:07:35.933
Rain Dance was skillfully executed.

133
00:07:36.366 --> 00:07:39.266
I wonder how Sawyer will deal with all of this.

134
00:07:39.766 --> 00:07:40.733
In that case...

135
00:07:41.166 --> 00:07:43.900
All right! Hydro Pump again!

136
00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:45.866
All right, Aegislash, King's Shield!

137
00:07:51.666 --> 00:07:54.033
Aegislash's stance. It changed.

138
00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:56.333
You're right.

139
00:08:01.833 --> 00:08:05.666
King's Shield allows it to change so it can defend against attacks.

140
00:08:05.733 --> 00:08:08.933
Not only that, it can also lower its opponent's attack power.

141
00:08:10.966 --> 00:08:13.266
King's Shield? Whoa.

142
00:08:13.333 --> 00:08:14.833
Time to counterattack.

143
00:08:15.266 --> 00:08:17.200
Aegislash, Sacred Sword!

144
00:08:21.866 --> 00:08:23.266
Hydro Pump, go!

145
00:08:25.433 --> 00:08:26.666
Slash!

146
00:08:28.166 --> 00:08:30.300
Ludicolo!

147
00:08:30.366 --> 00:08:32.366
- Oh, no!
- All right, Swords Dance!

148
00:08:39.299 --> 00:08:41.433
Ludicolo, use Solar Beam!

149
00:08:45.533 --> 00:08:47.466
Use Sacred Sword once more!

150
00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:58.233
Ludicolo...

151
00:08:58.666 --> 00:08:59.733
Ludicolo!

152
00:09:00.133 --> 00:09:02.033
Ludicolo is unable to battle!

153
00:09:02.566 --> 00:09:04.400
Aegislash is the winner!

154
00:09:04.466 --> 00:09:08.933
It worked! That Sacred Sword cut right through Ludicolo's Solar Beam,

155
00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:11.300
giving Aegislash a great victory!

156
00:09:11.366 --> 00:09:13.466
That puts Sawyer up 1-0!

157
00:09:14.233 --> 00:09:15.600
Thanks, Ludicolo.

158
00:09:16.766 --> 00:09:18.333
You deserve a good rest.

159
00:09:20.866 --> 00:09:21.900
Raichu!

160
00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:24.366
It's time to dance!

161
00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:36.266
Who's that Pokémon?

162
00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:43.100
It's Aegislash!

163
00:09:43.166 --> 00:09:44.533
Aegislash.

164
00:09:49.466 --> 00:09:51.600
Now, Raichu, use Charge Beam!

165
00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:56.233
King's Shield!

166
00:10:02.333 --> 00:10:04.266
Oh, no, that King's Shield again!

167
00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:06.733
All right, Aegislash, use Slash!

168
00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:08.100
Slash.

169
00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:11.466
Quick, use Dig!

170
00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:14.433
Rocking!

171
00:10:16.733 --> 00:10:21.133
By using Dig, Tierno's Raichu managed to dodge that slash!

172
00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:23.833
Here he comes.

173
00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:28.766
Yes!

174
00:10:31.066 --> 00:10:32.166
Aegislash!

175
00:10:33.766 --> 00:10:36.900
Aegislash is unable to battle! Raichu's the winner!

176
00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:43.133
Raichu, you ready to rock?

177
00:10:43.433 --> 00:10:46.133
Let's go with that rhythm!

178
00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.000
Thanks a lot, Aegislash.

179
00:10:50.233 --> 00:10:51.800
You take a good rest.

180
00:10:52.066 --> 00:10:55.300
- Now it's one-to-one.
- They're both giving it their all.

181
00:10:55.366 --> 00:10:57.433
This battle is so exciting.

182
00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:59.800
I wonder what Pokémon he'll use now.

183
00:11:00.533 --> 00:11:04.866
Uh, check, please. The last thing I need to hear is more talking heads.

184
00:11:04.933 --> 00:11:07.366
I'm burnt from Kalos League battle heat.

185
00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:12.166
I hate that phrase! If I hear it just one more time, I'll scream!

186
00:11:12.233 --> 00:11:13.800
We'll join you.

187
00:11:13.866 --> 00:11:14.866
Hold on.

188
00:11:15.066 --> 00:11:19.100
I say we quit this job and work on pilfering Pokémon full-time.

189
00:11:19.166 --> 00:11:21.833
You're right. That's a job worth working for.

190
00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:24.600
- Hey! I need you to get back to work.
- Huh?

191
00:11:24.666 --> 00:11:28.400
I can't do my job without you. Come on. Kalos League battle heat!

192
00:11:30.966 --> 00:11:33.166
Slurpuff, use Attract!

193
00:11:43.933 --> 00:11:44.933
No, Raichu!

194
00:11:45.366 --> 00:11:49.733
Look out. Tierno's Raichu has been struck with a potent attract!

195
00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:52.133
Raichu, Charge Beam!

196
00:11:57.166 --> 00:11:58.933
Oh, no!

197
00:11:59.833 --> 00:12:00.733
Energy Ball!

198
00:12:07.466 --> 00:12:08.700
Raichu, no!

199
00:12:11.166 --> 00:12:12.500
All right, return!

200
00:12:13.966 --> 00:12:16.300
With no choice, Raichu returns!

201
00:12:16.366 --> 00:12:17.833
Blastoise, now!

202
00:12:18.466 --> 00:12:19.366
Let's go!

203
00:12:21.433 --> 00:12:23.633
Blastoise!

204
00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:27.266
So, Blastoise is up next, huh?

205
00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:29.466
Slurpuff, use Attract!

206
00:12:31.800 --> 00:12:34.466
Now, Blastoise, it's time to dance!

207
00:12:39.800 --> 00:12:41.966
I get it. That's not gonna work.

208
00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:43.900
Hey, no surprise here.

209
00:12:43.966 --> 00:12:45.266
We're in the groove!

210
00:12:45.333 --> 00:12:46.966
Attract can't get through!

211
00:12:47.033 --> 00:12:48.466
Blastoise.

212
00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:51.200
What a team. Tierno and Blastoise.

213
00:12:51.633 --> 00:12:54.100
Clemont. Why isn't that attract working?

214
00:12:54.166 --> 00:12:57.233
I'd say it has something to do with mental toughness.

215
00:12:57.300 --> 00:12:59.466
Or maybe it's just because they're both male.

216
00:13:00.166 --> 00:13:01.266
Maybe so.

217
00:13:01.333 --> 00:13:04.066
Blastoise, use Hydro Cannon! Now!

218
00:13:06.633 --> 00:13:08.500
All right, Slurpuff, dodge it!

219
00:13:15.033 --> 00:13:16.366
No! Slurpuff!

220
00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:18.866
Slurpuff is unable to battle!

221
00:13:18.933 --> 00:13:20.900
Blastoise is the winner!

222
00:13:20.966 --> 00:13:23.233
Yeah!

223
00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:27.733
Thank you, Slurpuff. You deserve a good rest.

224
00:13:28.866 --> 00:13:30.733
Just one Pokémon left.

225
00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:32.000
It's up to you!

226
00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:33.666
Go, Sceptile!

227
00:13:35.166 --> 00:13:37.100
Sceptile!

228
00:13:37.166 --> 00:13:40.000
That Sceptile's got some amazing moves!

229
00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:42.233
Blastoise, let's do it!

230
00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:43.833
Use Ice Beam!

231
00:13:46.466 --> 00:13:49.100
Leaf storm, go!

232
00:13:53.066 --> 00:13:55.366
Awesome! I love a good challenge!

233
00:13:56.166 --> 00:13:57.300
Hydro Cannon!

234
00:13:58.666 --> 00:14:00.166
Dodge, then Leaf Blade!

235
00:14:08.066 --> 00:14:09.300
Blastoise!

236
00:14:10.766 --> 00:14:12.300
Blastoise...

237
00:14:14.166 --> 00:14:16.766
That Sceptile's really fast, all right.

238
00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:19.766
But for power, Blastoise is top of the charts!

239
00:14:19.833 --> 00:14:22.066
Now, Blastoise, use Skull Bash!

240
00:14:24.766 --> 00:14:26.800
Sceptile, Frenzy Plant!

241
00:14:31.966 --> 00:14:33.366
Blastoise, no!

242
00:14:34.066 --> 00:14:35.000
Use Rain Dance!

243
00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:47.766
What's that for? Why Rain Dance?

244
00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:56.833
Blastoise is unable to battle! Sceptile is the winner!

245
00:14:57.433 --> 00:15:00.100
Thanks, Blastoise. You gave it your all, buddy.

246
00:15:03.666 --> 00:15:06.666
Your Rain Dance will set us up for the next round.

247
00:15:06.733 --> 00:15:09.833
Raichu! Let's rock!

248
00:15:13.066 --> 00:15:15.600
And, finally, Sceptile versus Raichu!

249
00:15:15.666 --> 00:15:18.566
If you look at power, Sceptile's got the edge.

250
00:15:18.866 --> 00:15:23.300
But what's going on? Why did he call for that Rain Dance at the end?

251
00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:28.766
Who will move on to the semifinals?

252
00:15:28.833 --> 00:15:29.966
Is it Sawyer?

253
00:15:30.033 --> 00:15:31.633
Or is it Tierno?

254
00:15:32.100 --> 00:15:34.133
Now, Raichu! Use Thunder!

255
00:15:34.566 --> 00:15:37.566
Of course! Using Thunder in the rain never misses!

256
00:15:37.633 --> 00:15:39.400
Its accuracy is a sure thing!

257
00:15:39.466 --> 00:15:41.966
Sure thing? So, that's what it's all about.

258
00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:48.233
I've battled a lot. I've gained a whole bunch of great experience,

259
00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:49.733
and that's my strength!

260
00:15:55.966 --> 00:15:57.933
Sceptile! Mega Evolve!

261
00:16:17.933 --> 00:16:19.300
Sceptile.

262
00:16:19.366 --> 00:16:21.533
Sceptile Mega Evolved!

263
00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:23.533
Sawyer's secret weapon.

264
00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:25.066
It Mega Evolved?

265
00:16:25.133 --> 00:16:27.533
All right, then, use Thunder!

266
00:16:37.433 --> 00:16:38.700
Sceptile.

267
00:16:39.366 --> 00:16:40.433
It didn't work.

268
00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:44.300
They used lightning rod to defend against Raichu's big attack!

269
00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:48.933
When Sceptile Mega Evolves, its ability is called lightning rod.

270
00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:51.666
- Thunder won't work on it.
- It can't be.

271
00:16:51.733 --> 00:16:54.200
-Mega Sceptile, Dragon Claw!

272
00:16:56.566 --> 00:16:59.100
Focus blast! Go!

273
00:17:10.033 --> 00:17:11.500
Oh, no, Raichu!

274
00:17:17.733 --> 00:17:22.599
Raichu is unable to battle, which means the victory goes to Sawyer!

275
00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:34.133
I guess that's it for us.

276
00:17:34.966 --> 00:17:36.833
So, let's cheer for the winner.

277
00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:38.566
Oh, Tierno.

278
00:17:38.633 --> 00:17:42.100
I'd say Sawyer's sheer passion overwhelmed Tierno's power.

279
00:17:42.366 --> 00:17:46.333
It seems that's the one thing that made all the difference this time around.

280
00:17:47.066 --> 00:17:50.566
Yeah. And who knew that Sceptile could Mega Evolve?

281
00:17:52.633 --> 00:17:55.766
Sawyer's trained really hard to be at the Kalos League.

282
00:17:55.833 --> 00:17:58.600
- I can't wait for our battle.
- Pika, Pika.

283
00:17:59.266 --> 00:18:02.200
All the semifinal slots have now been filled!

284
00:18:02.266 --> 00:18:06.900
Starting with the semifinals, we'll be seeing full six-on-six battles!

285
00:18:07.166 --> 00:18:09.566
And here's what the matchups look like.

286
00:18:10.166 --> 00:18:12.333
It's Alain versus Remo!

287
00:18:13.300 --> 00:18:15.300
And it's Ash versus Sawyer!

288
00:18:16.333 --> 00:18:19.533
There is plenty of battle action coming up tomorrow.

289
00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:22.700
The Kalos League is really getting heated up.

290
00:18:27.466 --> 00:18:31.366
Ash, what are you gonna do about tomorrow's six-on-six battle?

291
00:18:31.800 --> 00:18:35.600
Yeah. You've only got five Pokémon. You've gotta figure something out.

292
00:18:36.033 --> 00:18:37.833
Ah! What time is it?

293
00:18:39.533 --> 00:18:40.566
Oh, no!

294
00:18:41.266 --> 00:18:43.400
- Huh? What's wrong?
- Wait up, Ash!

295
00:18:47.366 --> 00:18:49.400
He should be coming any minute.

296
00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:51.733
Huh? Who are you talking about?

297
00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:53.100
-Huh?

298
00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:55.366
There they are!

299
00:18:57.166 --> 00:18:58.833
- Hey, Goodra!
- Pika!

300
00:19:02.966 --> 00:19:04.833
Keanan. Thanks so very much.

301
00:19:04.900 --> 00:19:07.133
- This is great.
- It's my greatest pleasure.

302
00:19:08.566 --> 00:19:09.900
Pika!

303
00:19:09.966 --> 00:19:13.133
Goodra. So, then the last Pokémon on your team...

304
00:19:13.566 --> 00:19:16.900
Right. My sixth Pokémon is gonna be Goodra.

305
00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:19.233
Goodra.

306
00:19:19.966 --> 00:19:24.133
Actually, I'd already decided... back when we visited Goodra.

307
00:19:29.333 --> 00:19:32.166
- Almost time for the Kalos League.
- Goodra?

308
00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:36.466
If I can make it to the semifinals, it'll be six-on-six.

309
00:19:36.533 --> 00:19:39.233
But right now I only have five Pokémon.

310
00:19:39.300 --> 00:19:42.166
I thought maybe Professor Oak could send me one.

311
00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:46.333
Instead, there's someone else that I really wanna battle with.

312
00:19:46.800 --> 00:19:47.866
Goo?

313
00:19:51.066 --> 00:19:53.233
And, Goodra, that's you.

314
00:19:53.733 --> 00:19:56.400
Please battle by my side in the Kalos League.

315
00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:01.200
Goodra!

316
00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:03.500
Goodra, Goo!

317
00:20:03.566 --> 00:20:06.333
Aw, come on. You're really too much, Goodra.

318
00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:07.833
Goodra, Goo!

319
00:20:16.266 --> 00:20:20.666
There's no one else who could win in the Kalos League like you can.

320
00:20:20.733 --> 00:20:24.066
You're the best possible team. I know we can do it.

321
00:20:24.366 --> 00:20:27.600
We'll beat Sawyer together.

322
00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:31.400
Ash and his team of six Pokémon,

323
00:20:31.466 --> 00:20:32.800
now including Goodra,

324
00:20:32.866 --> 00:20:35.266
are getting ready for the semifinals.

325
00:20:35.333 --> 00:20:37.133
His opponent? Sawyer.

326
00:20:37.366 --> 00:20:38.200
The winner?

327
00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:41.733
The answer, along with lots of heated excitement,

328
00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:44.400
as the journey continues.
